{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And He shall judge</b> — The judge is the Messiah. Yefet said: HaShem and the word of YHWH. Others said: the people of Jerusalem, as if he said, \"and He shall judge with it.\" And to this day no generation has passed in which there was no war, and if one place was quiet, another was not, yet the verse says: \"Nation shall not lift up sword against nation, neither shall they learn war anymore.\""], :book :micah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Micah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=20&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:13:50.401096271Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}